# Workspace environment for the anthropic smoke harness.
#
# Unlike self-hosted providers (tensorrt_llm, ollama, lmstudio), the
# anthropic provider talks to a fixed cloud endpoint (api.anthropic.com),
# so the deployment knob is the *credential*, not the host.
#
# The value below is interpolated into .jaato/profiles/*.json at
# profile-load time via ${ANTHROPIC_API_KEY} substitution (see
# shared/plugins/subagent/config.py:_expand_string).  The key is then
# promoted to ProviderConfig.api_key by jaato_runtime.py:1149-1162.
#
# Primary: API key (uses API credits, console.anthropic.com).
# Generate one at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys.
#
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-...
#
# Alternative: Claude Pro/Max OAuth token (uses subscription, not
# credits).  Generate with `claude setup-token` after installing the
# Claude Code CLI.  If you go this route, set ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN here
# and switch the profile's plugin_configs.anthropic.api_key reference to
# plugin_configs.anthropic.oauth_token: "${ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN}".
#
#   ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=sk-ant-oat01-...
#
# Bare literals work but a `pass://` URI is preferred — the daemon
# resolves it before shipping to the runner, and the literal never
# touches the workspace .env on disk in plain text.
#
# The provider will error naturally if the credential is missing or
# rejected (APIKeyNotFoundError / APIKeyInvalidError with a helpful
# message).

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-REPLACE-ME
